@@ -0,0 +1,52 @@
+# Vendored: injectable_generator 3.1.3
+
+| | |
+|---|---|
+| Upstream | https://github.com/Milad-Akarie/injectable (`injectable_generator/`) |
+| Version | 3.1.3 (pub.dev) |
+| Upstream commit | `0644204687dfb34e7318c11fe4abf9416ed2c549` (tag `injectable_generator-3.1.3`) |
+| pub.dev archive | `injectable_generator-3.1.3.tar.gz`, sha256 `24d525c60ed9abf345c8749c3291ca1b3f1d21fd53344c0c644da820a92049df` |
+| Licence | MIT, `LICENSE` (byte-identical to the archive; see the note below) |
+
+## Why it is vendored
+
+injectable_generator 3.1.x depends on `lean_builder ^1.2.2`, and lean_builder 1.2.2
+requires `_fe_analyzer_shared >=98.0.0 <106.0.0`. This repository's ext lock
+(`dart/ext/pubspec.lock`) pins `analyzer 14.5.0`, which requires
+`_fe_analyzer_shared ^109.0.0`, so pub cannot resolve the generator into the lock.
+Every older injectable_generator caps analyzer below 10.
+
+The build_runner path (`lib/builder.dart`) imports only `package:build` and
+`package:source_gen`; `lean_builder` is used only by `lib/lean_builder/`, the
+optional lean_builder integration. Dropping that directory removes the dependency
+without touching the code the shims run.
+
+## Local changes (the only differences from the archive)
+
+1. `lib/lean_builder/` removed (5 files).
+2. `pubspec.yaml`: the `lean_builder` dependency is commented out.
+3. Not vendored: `test/`, `README.md`, `analysis_options.yaml`, `build.yaml`,
+   `run_coverage.sh` (the tests need `build_test` and lean_builder). `build.yaml`
+   is replaced by the two shims in `dart/ext/injectable/` (rules_dart never reads
+   `build.yaml`).
+
+No `.dart` file under `lib/` is modified.
+
+**LICENSE note:** the archive's `LICENSE` has no final newline, and this copy keeps it so
+(`git am` / a git checkout give the exact bytes). A consumer that applies this change as a
+patch with Bazel's `git_override(patches = ...)` gets one extra trailing newline: Bazel's
+patcher ignores the `\ No newline at end of file` marker. The licence text is unchanged.
+
+To check:
+
+```sh
+curl -sL https://pub.dev/api/archives/injectable_generator-3.1.3.tar.gz | tar xz -C /tmp/ig
+diff -r /tmp/ig/lib dart/ext/injectable/third_party/injectable_generator/lib   # only lean_builder/ differs
+```
+
+## Removing the vendored copy
+
+When upstream moves lean_builder into its own package (or lean_builder accepts
+`_fe_analyzer_shared` 109+), add `injectable_generator` to `dart/ext/pubspec.yaml`,
+relock, point `//dart/ext/injectable:*` at `@ext_pub_deps//:injectable_generator`
+and delete this directory.
diff --git a/dart/ext/injectable/third_party/injectable_generator/lib/builder.dart b/dart/ext/injectable/third_party/injectable_generator/lib/builder.dart
