+documents the wiring: `injectable_package(name, srcs, init, shard_deps, init_deps)` declares
+one `dart_codegen` per annotated file (`shim_json`, writes `[]` for a file with no injectable
+class) and one `dart_aggregate_codegen` over the `@InjectableInit` file (`shim_config`, the
+shards as `asset_deps`; it fails instead of writing an empty `.config.dart`). Keep the
+aggregate's `deps` to what the init file imports, so an edit that leaves every shard
+byte-identical is an action-cache hit for it. Both shims give the generator a
+`Resolver.libraries` in build_runner's order (a breadth-first walk over imports and exports
+from the input), because injectable picks the first exporting library as a type's import and
+hashes the rest into its registration order.
